{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d1b0ba564d0f246","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 8\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDelivers a run-comparison surface in the Dashboard: users select two or more training or pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side, with a diff presentation over the same surface that highlights which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs. This is the P0 core of the strategy and delivers independent user value (comparison today happens in exported spreadsheets).\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Multi-selection of two or more runs from the existing runs list in the Dashboard, covering both training runs and pipeline runs.\n38\t- Side-by-side rendering of the selected runs' parameters and metrics.\n39\t- A diff presentation over the same comparison surface that highlights which parameters and metrics differ between two selected runs (the strategy's \"diff view\" is a presentation mode of the side-by-side comparison over the same run data — one surface, two modes).\n40\t- The comparison reads run parameters and metrics through the same data sources that back the existing per-run Dashboard pages (no new data plane).\n41\t- Data Science Pipelines is a passive component in this strategy: no code changes there; the existing KFP v2 run surfaces continue to serve run data. Validation of that passive classification is an acceptance criterion below.\n42\t\n43\t## Acceptance Criteria\n44\t\n45\t- Given two or more runs selected from the runs list, When the user opens the comparison, Then all selected runs' parameters and metrics render side by side in the Dashboard.\n46\t- Given two runs in the comparison, When the user switches to the diff presentation, Then the parameters and metrics that changed between the two runs are highlighted.\n47\t- Given a mix of training runs and pipeline runs, When compared, Then both run kinds are selectable and their parameters and metrics render correctly in the comparison (this validates the passive Data Science Pipelines component — no Data Science Pipelines code changes are required for the comparison to work).\n48\t- The comparison is reachable without leaving the project context of the selected runs.\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: Users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side in the Dashboard — fully covered by this epic.\n53\t- **HLR-3 (P1, bundled with HLR-1)**: The run \"diff\" view is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data (same component, same team, same data structure); covering both in one epic avoids building the same surface twice. Covered at the epic's P0 priority.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b0b2a8f6cf7032e","agent_id":"a7bbe4cbb23cf47a6","session_id":"f3b104a1-b56c-4bb7-a36a-1ff96392a602","uuid":"cf65da7e-c8e1-44b5-b16d-af6b1ed65820","timestamp":"2026-10-26T22:11:05.211Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d1b0ba564d0f246","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015